rweg raakt hij echter betrokken bij een dreiging die groter is dan zijn eigen verlies. De voormalige onderdrukker moet bepalen welke rol hij wil spelen wanneer juist zijn kennis van belang kan zijn voor Midkemia.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL554723W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p268406022"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:20.152Z","reference":"work:3224","note":"Retain existing Work3224 Exile''s Return / Raymond E. Feist; exact Dutch De terugkeer van de banneling ISBN 9789022539323 Hardcover. Bibliography explicitly binds Dutch language, author, original title and source parent. Original content review content-review-023.json re-read, including Deposed Kaspar struggles as exile; Guarding traders offers route home; He discovers key to new outside threat. No new Work, author merge, additional Dutch availability or unreviewed taste feature.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-023.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL554723W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p268406022"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL27276228M","isbn13":"9789022539323","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T11:21:20.152Z","note":"Bound earlier exact source attempt. Do not infer absence of cover; no unreviewed image imported. Existing resolver plus exact hosted decoded front or explicit neutral missing state required.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15168616,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"58719a887e37afaee07f3ba2662461b1c1b62ede456d5ce88290b18ebee164de"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"provenance":"original_source_revi