lijkt mogelijk dat zij iets heeft gezien wat verborgen moest blijven. Zijn onderzoek krijgt gaandeweg verbindingen met een extreemrechts complot tegen de veranderingen in Zuid-Afrika. De afstand tussen een plaatselijke moord en internationale politieke belangen blijkt kleiner dan verwacht. Wallander moet die samenhang onderzoeken terwijl ook zijn persoonlijke problemen aandacht blijven vragen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL158630W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p294881468"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:20.152Z","reference":"work:5832","note":"Retain existing Work5832 Den vita lejoninnan / Henning Mankell; exact Dutch De witte leeuwin ISBN 9789044508772 mass market paperback. Bibliography explicitly binds Dutch language, author, original title and source parent. Original content review content-review-023.json re-read, including Louise Åkerblom is murdered in rural Skåne in 1992; Wallander''s investigation links to plot against anti-apartheid process in South Africa. No new Work, author merge, additional Dutch availability or unreviewed taste feature.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-023.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL158630W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p294881468"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL34367865M","isbn13":"9789044508772","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T11:21:20.152Z","note":"Bound earlier exact source attempt. Do not infer absence of cover; no unreviewed image imported. Existing resolver plus exact hosted decoded front or explicit neutral missing state required.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":12033234,"status":"bulk_source_failure_no_retry","receiptSha256":"58719a887e37afaee07f3