eurige verdeling tussen schuldige, bemiddelaar en slachtoffer blijkt geen bescherming tegen het geweld waarin zij terechtkomen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL16342070W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p330311506"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:20.152Z","reference":"work:6006","note":"Retain existing Work6006 Sorry / Zoran Drvenkar; exact Dutch Sorry ISBN 9789029575379 Paperback. Bibliography explicitly binds Dutch language, author, original title and source parent. Original content review content-review-033.json re-read, including FourBerlinersmakebusinessapologizingforcompanies; Clientasksforapologytodeadwoman; Theyareforcedintoviolentgame. No new Work, author merge, additional Dutch availability or unreviewed taste feature.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-033.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL16342070W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p330311506"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL35327499M","isbn13":"9789029575379","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T11:21:20.152Z","note":"Bound earlier exact source attempt. Do not infer absence of cover; no unreviewed image imported. Existing resolver plus exact hosted decoded front or explicit neutral missing state required.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":12980028,"status":"prior_source_failure_no_new_request","receiptSha256":"58719a887e37afaee07f3ba2662461b1c1b62ede456d5ce88290b18ebee164de","historicalFailure":{"reference":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"58719a887e37afaee07f3ba2662461b1c1b62ede456d5ce88290b18ebee164de","archiveUrl":"https://archive.org/download/covers_0012/covers_0012_98.zip","sourceError":"Image member checksum/type mismatch","no